WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.090
The oldest division in the Muslim world is
the Sunni-Shiite split.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:13.450
Downplaying its ecumenical approach towards
spreading the Islamic revolution, Tehran has

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.770
now embraced Shiite supremacy.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:22.050
And Sunnis and Shiites—from Lebanon to Afghanistan,
Syria to Yemen—are nearly equal in number.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:26.810
Iran has tens of thousands of foreign Shiites
under the command of the Revolutionary Guard.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:32.090
Never in modern history have we seen a Muslim
state—not the pan-Arabists of yesteryear or

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:37.270
the ever-proselytizing Saudis—deploy such
expeditionary forces into battle.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.200
Iranian Islamist imperialism, backed up by
the ambitions and firepower of Vladimir Putin's

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.800
Russia, now dominates the northern Middle
East.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:50.239
It's only a matter of time before Tehran aims
its convulsive intentions towards the Shiites

00:00:50.239 --> 00:00:52.699
of Bahrain and Saudi Arabia.

00:00:52.699 --> 00:00:57.320
United Nation's conventional arms restrictions
against Iran come off in 2020; the

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.300
nuclear deal's restraints start falling in
2023.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:05.640
An Iranian Islamist hegemon is rising and
the United States is just watching.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:10.920
For a deeper understanding of the Iranian clerical regime's quest to dominate the Middle East,

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:14.580
see the link to the book "Rise of the Revisionists" in the description below.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:19.720
